            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm not sure if this is an authentic recipe, but I have made this many times when getting over a cold because it uses ingredients that I nearly always have around. I've even subbed tomato sauce for the fresh tomato and it still hits the spot. I just use less tamarind because my paste is very concentrated, and sometimes I add dried red chili to the tempering.",
